1
00:00:00,988 --> 00:00:02,988
(sighs)
Here we go again.

2
00:00:02,990 --> 00:00:05,760
(Penny:)Why is everyone so concerned
with us setting a date?

3
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:07,190
(Penny:)We're committed to
each other. We're happy.

4
00:00:07,194 --> 00:00:09,624
(Penny:)A ceremony isn't gonna
change anything.

5
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:12,160
(Sheldon:)So you're never getting married?

6
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:14,870
(Sheldon:)It's his whining, isn't it?

7
00:00:14,869 --> 00:00:17,639
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I'm not a whiner.

8
00:00:20,774 --> 00:00:23,004
(Sheldon:)It's amusing
that he doesn't hear it.

9
00:00:24,177 --> 00:00:27,317
(Leonard:)Look, all she's saying
is we are in love

10
00:00:27,314 --> 00:00:28,784
(Leonard:)so it doesn't matter
if we get married

11
00:00:28,783 --> 00:00:32,053
(Leonard:)tomorrow or a year from now
or 50 years from now.

12
00:00:32,053 --> 00:00:34,753
(Penny:)Ew, 50?
We'll be old and gross.

13
00:00:34,755 --> 00:00:37,425
(Leonard:)Yeah, but we'll be old
and gross together.

14
00:00:37,425 --> 00:00:38,825
SHELDON:
My aunt and uncle

15
00:00:38,826 --> 00:00:41,156
(Sheldon:)were married 63 years.

16
00:00:41,162 --> 00:00:44,132
(Sheldon:)Towards the end, it was
like watching cheese melt.

17
00:00:55,008 --> 00:01:03,018
(Penny:)Um... I'm
free tonight.

